    '<p>Run <code>pnpm client:replay -- --json --swift</code>, <code>pnpm boundaries</code> and <code>pnpm check</code>. The replay driver compares six literal TypeScript and independent Swift outcomes. Boundary fixtures reject forbidden static, type-only, dynamic and re-export edges and transitive public-type leaks. Missing Swift is unavailable, not a passing test.</p>\n' +
